        <mxCell id="n-env" value="DEV specifics: Aurora serverlessv2 (0.5&#8211;2.0 ACU), deletion-protection OFF, 1d backup. MSK is OFF (enable_msk=false) &#8212; so api-agent's kafka-cluster:* grant exists in the role but has NO MSK target in dev (unused). NAT 1 (single). All 5 per-env KMS keys + 6 task roles identical to beta/prod. github-pat-amplify secret NOT created (enable_amplify=false)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=light-dark(#FFF8E1,#3A3320);strokeColor=#FFB300;fontColor=light-dark(#5D4037,#FFE0B2);size=14;" vertex="1" parent="aws"><mxGeometry x="1850" y="440" width="580" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
